1
00:00:00,958 --> 00:00:02,833
Severin was just talking nonsense.

2
00:00:03,708 --> 00:00:05,833
He works dawn to dusk in the mines-

3
00:00:05,916 --> 00:00:06,708
That’s right.

4
00:00:07,291 --> 00:00:09,708
Severin is with us in
the mines every single day.

5
00:00:10,250 --> 00:00:11,500
We’ll swear on our lives.

6
00:00:12,541 --> 00:00:13,541
All day in the mines.

7
00:00:13,541 --> 00:00:14,666
What about nights to sleep together too?

8
00:00:14,666 --> 00:00:15,500
Mother, what’s happening?!

9
00:00:22,375 --> 00:00:23,125
Mother, what’s going on?

10
00:00:23,125 --> 00:00:26,916
This trash planted spies in our castle to watch me!

11
00:00:26,916 --> 00:00:28,041
What?!

12
00:00:28,291 --> 00:00:30,708
You actually planted spies inside the Scott family?

13
00:00:30,708 --> 00:00:31,875
Your mom should watch her mouth.

14
00:00:33,666 --> 00:00:35,583
Then how do you explain knowing about

15
00:00:35,583 --> 00:00:37,291
my petrified organs?

16
00:00:37,541 --> 00:00:38,875
Dark magic all over you.

17
00:00:40,541 --> 00:00:43,375
Organs turning to
stone, blood moon curse.

18
00:00:43,750 --> 00:00:46,875
Your cycle's all messed up. Sometimes every two weeks.

19
00:00:46,875 --> 00:00:48,458
Sometimes nothing for months.

20
00:00:48,875 --> 00:00:51,291
The royal oracle's been
treating you forever, right?

21
00:00:52,125 --> 00:00:53,250
And when it hits, 

22
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:54,541
it's unbearable.

23
00:00:54,958 --> 00:00:57,458
How… how could you know that?

24
00:00:57,958 --> 00:01:00,458
Because I am
a master of healing.

25
00:01:03,375 --> 00:01:04,541
Can you heal me?

26
00:01:05,125 --> 00:01:06,625
If you cure me, 

27
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:09,541
I'll forgive everything you've done today.

28
00:01:11,750 --> 00:01:13,250
I heal who I want.

29
00:01:14,375 --> 00:01:17,083
You’re the first one
stupid enough to blackmail me.

30
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:18,875
Enough, Severin!

31
00:01:19,291 --> 00:01:21,583
Stop feeding my mother your cheap charlatan tricks.

32
00:01:22,583 --> 00:01:23,541
Believe whatever you want.

33
00:01:23,750 --> 00:01:26,000
Just don’t come crawling to me later begging for help.

34
00:01:26,125 --> 00:01:26,958
Forget that.

35
00:01:27,125 --> 00:01:28,916
Who gave you
permission to drag these

36
00:01:28,916 --> 00:01:30,916
filthy lowborns into a noble wedding?!
